{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Idle Card Collection Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong><br>In this idle card game, you can expand your collection and grow your fortune without staring at the screen for hours.<br>Through simple idle mechanics and strategic decisions, you can automatically acquire cards, complete tasks, and build your very own card gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Collection</strong>: Earn coins and resources even while offline\u2014effortless and beginner\u2011friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Trading</strong>: Sell your extra cards on the market, track price fluctuations, and make a profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pricing System</strong>: Market prices change over time\u2014buy low, sell high, and maximize the value of your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Exploration</strong>: Unlock new areas and obtain rare cards through exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Album &amp; Achievements</strong>: Complete card sets to unlock achievement and special rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Is This Game For?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy collecting, trading, and idle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual players looking for an easy\u2011to\u2011pick\u2011up game with long\u2011term growth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey to build the ultimate card collection and watch your wealth grow!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Draw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3923240/85c41486ee6179917ffbc38de5e170ddd450c109.jpg"},{"name":"Book of Hundreds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/s